"Intervals: {0} x {1} m ({2}:{3}-{4}:{5} /km)":"Series: {0} x {1} m ({2}:{3}-{4}:{5} /km)",
"Easy {0} km + {1} x {2} s strides":"Suave {0} km + {1} x {2} s de progresivos",
"Threshold {0} x {1} min, or Tempo {2} km on alternate weeks":"Umbral {0} x {1} min, o tempo {2} km en semanas alternas",
